    "answer": "The audio data was gathered from the All India Radio news channel, where an actor reads news for about 5-10 minutes. The data was collected from 2010 to 2019 to cover many speakers. The audio was segmented into smaller chunks using a Voice activity detector, and music segments were removed using an in-house music detection model to ensure the dataset was clean. The final dataset contains 635 hours of clean audio, divided into 520 hours of training data with 165,000 utterances and 115 hours of testing data with 35,000 utterances [E3].",
